0..79 Comment "//! A method that answers a place. A method whose receiver\'s mode is a variable"
80..158 Comment "//! of its implicit block, `self : m T` under `[m : Mode]`, answers a place of"
159..237 Comment "//! its receiver at that mode, `View[m](a)`, its returner the one the lowering"
238..316 Comment "//! inserts at a result: its body is the place, `self.#[i]`, and a call is the"
317..398 Comment "//! access to it. A call with a block, `xs.first() as w { … }`, lends the place"
399..474 Comment "//! at the mode the block asks — a resume or an abort through `w` asks an"
475..557 Comment "//! exclusive lend, a read alone a shared one — and a call without one reads the"
558..636 Comment "//! place. One body serves every mode, as an explicit object parameter deduces"
637..694 Comment "//! its receiver\'s qualifiers [Azman-2021-deducing_this]."
695..698 Comment "//!"
699..715 Comment "//! - see: #2255"
716..755 Comment "//! - cites: [Azman-2021-deducing_this]"
756..759 Comment "//!"
760..910 Comment "//! [Azman-2021-deducing_this]: https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2021/p0847r7.html \"Ažman, Brand, Deane and Revzin, Deducing this\""
